@basePath = https://vertx-erp-api.onrender.com/api
@personId = 1

### Obtener todas las personas
GET {{basePath}}/person
Accept: application/json

### Obtener una persona por ID
GET {{basePath}}/person/{{personId}}
Accept: application/json

### Crear una persona
POST {{basePath}}/person
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Pérez",
  "address": "Av. Siempre Viva 123",
  "weight": 72.5,
  "dateOfDate": "1990-05-20",
  "code": "P001"
}

### Actualizar una persona por ID
PUT {{basePath}}/person/{{personId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan Pérez Actualizado",
  "address": "Calle Nueva 456",
  "weight": 75.0,
  "dateOfDate": "1990-05-20",
  "code": "P001-A"
}

### Eliminar una persona por ID
DELETE {{basePath}}/person/6a20b3f10839f460bbe9803b
Accept: application/json
